<title>USA: Stamford, Conn., $30 mln GOs won by Morgan Stanley. [CORRECTED 16:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>Stamford, Conn., $30 mln GOs won by Morgan Stanley. [CORRECTED 16:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Securities (corrects from Prudential Securities) said Wednesday it won $30 million Stamford, Conn., general obligation bonds at a true interest cost of 5.1744 (corrects from 5.16) percent.</p>
</text>
